#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Find the components for the vampiric ritual"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the components for the vampiric ritual"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Gather the components your book mention and bring them to your mentor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Before things ended did you see any of the interviews with some of the "
"remaining Wampanoag?  They kept saying things about other races coming back "
"to this planet.  That's crazy, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"A few nights after I got here, I saw lights in the woods off in the distance."
"  I don't know why, but I ran back into the house turned off all the lights "
"and closed the blinds.  It was just so eerie!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"There could be anything out there.  Remember towards the end before the "
"apocalypse?  I remember tons of weird stuff I heard on the radio.  Like, I "
"heard out past Bunyan there were strange trees and species showing up in the "
"deep woods, stuff no one had ever seen before.  The Border Patrol was going "
"in about 'species previously thought extinct' or something like that.  Didn't"
" make sense to me.  Why the heck was the *Border Patrol* talking about "
"*closing off forests*?  Weird stuff.  I guess that means I don't have a clue "
"what's out there now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I still can't decide if our leaders thought Canada was a threat or what?  Why"
" else did they militarize the border patrol up here just as bad it had been "
"on the southern border for decades?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I remember talking to a friend coming back from Vegas a few years back and he"
" mentioned Border Patrol had those big armored Bear Cub vehicles with a "
"roadblock going into one of the canyons outside of Vegas.  Hundreds of miles "
"from any border.  Weird stuff man, I wonder if it's all connected?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What does this story remind me of?  Is it, Rip van Winkle?  Didn't he join "
"some party and come home a dozen years later?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "Maybe we should avoid drinking anything there?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Is Lewis Carrol hiding behind a bush over there?  Because if not, this sounds"
" insane and insanely dangerous.  But no one else has even given us a hint "
"about a way off this world of the dead.  Can we really pass this by?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "It's you and me buddy, to infinity and beyond!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "[Autumn Glamour] *Use Scarecrow's Mien*."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "The glamour fails to take hold!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_green>[Hypnotic Gaze] *Look directly into their eyes*</color>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "*blanches and takes a step back before turning and fleeing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Watch them go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"*stares stupidly as you meet <mypossesivepronoun> gaze and overwhelm "
"<mypossesivepronoun> pitiful mind.  Pathetic.  Like a lamb awaiting the "
"slaughter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"*stares blankly as you meet <mypossesivepronoun> gaze and overwhelm "
"<mypossesivepronoun> mind.  As <mypossesivepronoun> hands fall listlessly to "
"<mypossesivepronoun> sides, <mypossesivepronoun> gaze becomes unfocused and "
"<mypossesivepronoun> mouth drops half-open."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Ha.  Mortals are nothing but cattle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Well, that's one problem solved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"[Paraclesian:Elemental] Oh you're much less aggressive than other humans.  "
"Are you a different breed?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "[Paraclesian:Dollkin] Finally a normal human!  What's happened here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You mean the ferals?  Almost everyone left alive will try to kill you just "
"like the zombies out there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You mean the ferals?  How can you not know about the ferals?  Is this a trap?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"When the world broke it seems like it broke most people's minds and locked "
"them in on a single response to everything around them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Where have you been?  It's the end of the world and most people have gone "
"crazy!  Are you trying to distract me?"
msgstr ""

