msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dhampir (Species)" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One of your parents was always a little odd.  They stayed out of the sun as "
"much as they could, their eyes were a bit of an odd color, and they vanished "
"without a trace before you grew old enough to ask them why they left the room"
" every time you got a scrape that drew blood.  But now that you're older, you"
" understand.  You are the child of a vampire, and have inherited a small "
"portion of their power."
msgstr ""

