msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions group, you specialized in tracking, "
"killing and retrieving useful components from the cyborg tribes that seem to "
"exist on some of the worlds Xedra had access to.  Do you feel guilt about "
"bringing back the cybernetic components that are now inside you or your "
"teammates?  Or do you worry that now they might be on this world hunting you?"
"  You've lost your sidearm and spent half of your heavy ordnance.  Worst of "
"all, you're out of smokes."
msgstr ""

