msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Skinchanger (Bear)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Skinchanger (Bear)" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you were the member of a cult, or a strange family legacy, or maybe "
"you just stumbled on a book that probably shouldn't have been left where you "
"could find it.  Regardless, you have the ability to turn into an animal when "
"you kill it and make a talisman out of its bones and skin.  Every change "
"requires a death, but with so much death already since the Cataclysm, what's "
"a little bit more?"
msgstr ""

